{"id":"00177","root":"uni00177_1","name":{"ja":"清水　神流","en":"Shimizu Kanna"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"清水　神流","en":"Shimizu Kanna"},"aliases":["Shimizu Kaminaru"],"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-03-31","limited":false,"characterId":141,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園に通っている対魔忍。氷遁の術を使い、対魔忍としてもいくつかの任務に就き着実に経験と実績を積み重ねている。任務中は常に杖を装備しており、その杖を使って氷遁を使っている。だが、この杖は水城ゆきかぜ同様に自身の強すぎる力を抑えるために用いられている。身長が150センチしかなく、自身には少しコンプレックスを感じているが、その分胸が発達している。ちなみに身長の割に胸が発達していることも彼女にはコンプレックスだったりする。後輩からは慕われているが、ゆきかぜや雫からは慕われつつも胸の件で若干睨まれている視線を感じている。また、対魔忍として活躍しており後輩でもある七瀬舞とは仲が良い。","en":"(Shimizu Kanna, she/her) A Taimanin attending Gosha Academy. She uses ice-style ninjutsu and has steadily built experience and a solid record across several missions. During missions she always equips a staff, which she uses to perform her ice techniques. Like Mizuki Yukikaze, the staff also helps suppress her own overwhelming power. Standing only 150 cm tall, she feels a bit self-conscious about her height, though her chest has developed proportionally—something she also worries about. She's admired by juniors, but senses a slightly wary glance from Yukikaze and Shizuku regarding her bust. She remains active as a Taimanin and gets along well with junior Nanase Mai."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"卯眠ざくろ","forms":[{"id":"uni00177_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[878,1756],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[93,186],"def":[95,190],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","150009"]},{"id":"uni00177_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1356,2712],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[136,272],"def":[140,280],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","150009","150010"]},{"id":"uni00177_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1834,3668],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[179,354],"def":[185,374],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","150009","150010"]}],"skills":{"4":{"s